#: ../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:218
msgid "3.2.3 SIMT Compiler（Ascend 950）"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:220
msgid "昇腾 950 在 SIMD 路径之外增加 SIMT 能力，用于加速**非结构化 / 离散**访存（如间接索引的 load/store）。 开发者通过 `compile_mode` 选择编译路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:223
msgid "3.2.3.1 `compile_mode` 说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../zh/architecture_design_and_core_features.md:0
